    <entry>
      <title>CMake基础教程(二)：如何在 Visual Studio Code 上优雅地配置CMake</title>
      <link href="/2026/02/14/cmake_tutorial/cmake_2/"/>
      <url>/2026/02/14/cmake_tutorial/cmake_2/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="你需要用到的插件"><a href="#你需要用到的插件" class="headerlink" title="你需要用到的插件"></a>你需要用到的插件</h1><p>在 Extensions 中搜索’cmake’就能找到以下插件</p><p><img src="images/image2-1.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>前两个是我们主要所需要的，其他插件可按需下载</p><h1 id="配置"><a href="#配置" class="headerlink" title="配置"></a>配置</h1><p>安装后如果使用 VSCode 打开包含 <code>CMakelists.txt</code> 的文件夹时，上方会自动弹出选项</p><p><img src="images/image2-2.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>或者输入 <code>&gt;cmake:quick start</code> 并点击</p><p><img src="images/image2-3.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>同样也会创建 CMake 配置，且当不存在 <code>CMakelists.txt</code> 会自动创建一个</p><p>选择我们需要用的编译器，此时基本已经<strong>创建完成</strong>，并会生成 <strong>build</strong> 文件夹，文件夹下面是构建出的临时文件和可执行文件等</p><p>左下角有三个按键：</p><p><img src="images/image2-4.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>分别为 <strong>构建(Build)</strong>、<strong>Debug</strong>、<strong>运行(Run)</strong></p><ul><li>构建(Build)是将代码使用CMake构建成可执行文件</li><li>Debug用于进行测试</li><li>运行(Run)则是运行可执行文件，当我们代码在上次构建之后有修改过，会自动执行一次构建并运行</li></ul><p>如果再次输入 <code>&gt;cmake:quick start</code>，便会创建一个 present，选择编译器，输入 present 的名称，便会生成一个 <code>CMakePersents.json</code>，默认内容如下：<br><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">&quot;version&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">8</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">&quot;configurePresets&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;cmake_learn&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;displayName&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;GCC 15.2.0 x86_64-w64-mingw32&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;Using compilers: C = P:\\mingw64\\bin\\gcc.exe, CXX = P:\\mingw64\\bin\\g++.exe&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;generator&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;MinGW Makefiles&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;binaryDir&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;$&#123;sourceDir&#125;/out/build/$&#123;presetName&#125;&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;cacheVariables&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;$&#123;sourceDir&#125;/out/install/$&#123;presetName&#125;&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_C_COMPILER&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;P:/mingw64/bin/gcc.exe&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;P:/mingw64/bin/g++.exe&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;Debug&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><ul><li><code>&quot;generator&quot;</code>：所使用的生成器</li><li><code>&quot;binaryDir&quot;</code>：构建所生成文件的路径</li><li><code>&quot;cacheVariables&quot;</code>：运行 CMake 所用的参数</li></ul><p>这里建议将 <code>&quot;binaryDir&quot;</code> 改为 <code>&quot;${sourceDir}/build&quot;</code>，以及将 <code>&quot;CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX&quot;</code> 改为 <code>&quot;${sourceDir}/install&quot;</code></p><p>CLion (<em><a href="https://blog.jetbrains.com/clion/2025/05/clion-is-now-free-for-non-commercial-use/">CLion 去年对非商用途人群免费了</a></em>)等 IDE (集成开发环境)可以从创建项目的页面中创建 CMake 项目并更改需要的参数，但我更偏向于使用 VSCode 这类‘<strong>文本编辑器</strong>’，它更快，更轻便，缺点是有些东西可能需要折腾一阵子</p><p>但话说回来：<strong>萝卜青菜，各有所爱</strong></p>]]></content>
      
      
